Third-party components
======================

Cowrie (https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie) is BSD-3-Clause licensed. `cowrie/discord.py` in
this repository is a modified copy of Cowrie's Discord output module: it adds an events
allowlist so the channel is not flooded by every keystroke a bot types. Cowrie's licence
and copyright apply to that file; see the upstream project.

DB-IP Lite (https://db-ip.com) is used for offline geo lookups. It is not redistributed here
-- the installer downloads it -- both because it is large and because it carries its own
attribution requirements.
